(6424585, 953132, 131284, '<td valign="top">I have to say I don''t like this image, initially because it appears to have virtually no post processing or effort put in to framing etc, very much like a snapshot...<br/> <br/>However on reflection this was obviously intentional and really makes the image as disturbing as it is, more real life than horror movie, which also makes me dislike the image quite a lot.<br/> <br/>Again though, obviously this image set out to provoke an emotion, it has, and so I think you''ve done a fantastic job. I don''t like looking at this image but that should be viewed as a triumph on your part =). 7</td>', 'I have to say I don''t like this image, initially because it appears to have virtually no post processing or effort put in to framing etc, very much like a snapshot... However on reflection this was obviously intentional and really makes the image as disturbing as it is, more real life than horror movie, which also makes me dislike the image quite a lot. Again though, obviously this image set out to provoke an emotion, it has, and so I think you''ve done a fantastic job. I don''t like looking at this image but that should be viewed as a triumph on your part =). 7', '2011-05-25 17:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
