(6425076, 953189, 11467, '<td valign="top">Jeez, I wish my fridge was that clean!<br/>Nice photo. A bit more light in the back of bottom shelf would have been good. Probably only possible by moving your bottom light further away so it has a more gradual fall off, or by using a gridded or snooted light aimed at the broccoli. maybe if the  bottom light was raised up to just below the camera. The soft lighting works well though. 7</td>', 'Jeez, I wish my fridge was that clean!Nice photo. A bit more light in the back of bottom shelf would have been good. Probably only possible by moving your bottom light further away so it has a more gradual fall off, or by using a gridded or snooted light aimed at the broccoli. maybe if the  bottom light was raised up to just below the camera. The soft lighting works well though. 7', '2011-05-26 09:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
