(6425154, 953197, 63503, '<td valign="top">This is a great image, as are most of yours. I really like the lighting in this one. I think you used 4 lights but I am not sure, I hope you will enlighten us with a diagram at the end. My guess is that your main light is a snoot above and to the right of the camera. The second (lighting the figure) is below the edge of the photo and in front of the subject, probably also a snoot. A third one inside the fridge behind the figure and a fourth one behind the fridge. How close am I? (10)</td>', 'This is a great image, as are most of yours. I really like the lighting in this one. I think you used 4 lights but I am not sure, I hope you will enlighten us with a diagram at the end. My guess is that your main light is a snoot above and to the right of the camera. The second (lighting the figure) is below the edge of the photo and in front of the subject, probably also a snoot. A third one inside the fridge behind the figure and a fourth one behind the fridge. How close am I? (10)', '2011-05-26 12:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
