(6430356, 953205, 129267, '<td valign="top">I really enjoyed this shot, and the creativity and prep work that went into it. I voted it a 7. For me what kept the score from being a bit higher is that the yellowish hue in the fridge is less than attractive. A more pure/whiter color would have made things look a little more crisp. I also wish the crop was a bit more symmetrical, maybe by cropping the left side a bit. <br/> <br/>the breathing room at the top is nice, and I like the items in the drawer, they help to anchor the laptop to the fridge.</td>', 'I really enjoyed this shot, and the creativity and prep work that went into it. I voted it a 7. For me what kept the score from being a bit higher is that the yellowish hue in the fridge is less than attractive. A more pure/whiter color would have made things look a little more crisp. I also wish the crop was a bit more symmetrical, maybe by cropping the left side a bit.  the breathing room at the top is nice, and I like the items in the drawer, they help to anchor the laptop to the fridge.', '2011-06-01 05:56:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6430358, 953186, 129267, '<td valign="top">I gave this one an 8. <br/> <br/>The idea and execution were both well done. Congrats on your top 5</td>', 'I gave this one an 8.  The idea and execution were both well done. Congrats on your top 5', '2011-06-01 06:01:24.000000', NULL, 0),
