(6430361, 953195, 45631, '<td valign="top">Saw you post in the Fridge thread.<br/> <br/>This photo may be technically correct (black and white conversion is good) but it''s not interesting, its busy and there is no point of focus.  <br/> <br/>Look at your image and pretend somebody else shot it.<br/> <br/>Is this image interesting?<br/>Does it hold your attention?<br/>Is there something in the image that draws you into it?<br/> <br/></td>', 'Saw you post in the Fridge thread. This photo may be technically correct (black and white conversion is good) but it''s not interesting, its busy and there is no point of focus.   Look at your image and pretend somebody else shot it. Is this image interesting?Does it hold your attention?Is there something in the image that draws you into it? ', '2011-06-01 06:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
