(6430454, 953132, 130301, '<td valign="top">23 ones! I''m not surprised.  I like photos that express the darker side of things... occasionally.  This IS art, whether someone finds it in bad taste, or "glorifies violence"  I believe it was Picasso that said, "taste is the enemy of creativity."  Not my overall favorite, but interesting concept.<br/></td>', '23 ones! I''m not surprised.  I like photos that express the darker side of things... occasionally.  This IS art, whether someone finds it in bad taste, or "glorifies violence"  I believe it was Picasso that said, "taste is the enemy of creativity."  Not my overall favorite, but interesting concept.', '2011-06-01 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(6430473, 953197, 121949, '<td valign="top">Congrats! I kind of figured you had this won even before the challenge started. Then when I saw your entry I knew you had it in the bag! Love your work and creativity. You make it look simple, even when I know how hard it is.</td>', 'Congrats! I kind of figured you had this won even before the challenge started. Then when I saw your entry I knew you had it in the bag! Love your work and creativity. You make it look simple, even when I know how hard it is.', '2011-06-01 08:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
