(6430625, 953205, 39057, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your comment and vote. The crop did bother me a bit. However, on the yellowish hue...I looked on three computers prior to entering and it looks quite gray/white with no yellow.  I''m wondering if others saw yellow also ?<br/> <br/>Thanks again,<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jamesgoss:</b></div><hr/><i> I really enjoyed this shot, and the creativity and prep work that went into it. I voted it a 7. For me what kept the score from being a bit higher is that the yellowish hue in the fridge is less than attractive. A more pure/whiter color would have made things look a little more crisp. I also wish the crop was a bit more symmetrical, maybe by cropping the left side a bit. <br/> <br/>the breathing room at the top is nice, and I like the items in the drawer, they help to anchor the laptop to the fridge. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thanks for your comment and vote. The crop did bother me a bit. However, on the yellowish hue...I looked on three computers prior to entering and it looks quite gray/white with no yellow.  I''m wondering if others saw yellow also ? Thanks again, Originally posted by jamesgoss: I really enjoyed this shot, and the creativity and prep work that went into it. I voted it a 7. For me what kept the score from being a bit higher is that the yellowish hue in the fridge is less than attractive. A more pure/whiter color would have made things look a little more crisp. I also wish the crop was a bit more symmetrical, maybe by cropping the left side a bit.  the breathing room at the top is nice, and I like the items in the drawer, they help to anchor the laptop to the fridge. ', '2011-06-01 10:59:52.000000', NULL, 0),
