(6430915, 953078, 49773, '<td valign="top"><i>Constructive criticism:</i> <br/> <br/>In my opinion, the photo is technically very well executed. The symmetry in the arrangement is a bit dull though. Overall, the stock photography appearance brings nothing interesting or exciting. The glimpse of the fridge shelf in the background wasn''t very prominent, and without the context of the challenge it looks like a distraction. I assume your intention of DNMC warning in the title was to advocate the setup, in order to remove any possible dilemma the voter might have, and to ensure your photo gets the desired credit and the score. <br/> <br/>I find the obvious explanations of photographer''s intentions in the title a bit banal and bad tasted. You might have found my previous comment a bit rude, but my intention wasn''t to insult your or put your photograph down, just to get my point across directly and with a bit of cynicism, without any beating around the bush.  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Constructive criticism:  In my opinion, the photo is technically very well executed. The symmetry in the arrangement is a bit dull though. Overall, the stock photography appearance brings nothing interesting or exciting. The glimpse of the fridge shelf in the background wasn''t very prominent, and without the context of the challenge it looks like a distraction. I assume your intention of DNMC warning in the title was to advocate the setup, in order to remove any possible dilemma the voter might have, and to ensure your photo gets the desired credit and the score.  I find the obvious explanations of photographer''s intentions in the title a bit banal and bad tasted. You might have found my previous comment a bit rude, but my intention wasn''t to insult your or put your photograph down, just to get my point across directly and with a bit of cynicism, without any beating around the bush.   ', '2011-06-01 13:59:33.000000', NULL, 0),
