(6430986, 953205, 39057, '<td valign="top">Ha...I guess my time will come ! For 30 votes or so, I thought this would be it !  Oh well...I do have a 7.2 image that did not get a ribbon !<br/> <br/>I usually have great ideas and don''t try to shoot it or fail as shooting it. This one almost succeded.<br/> <br/>I have a few ideas for upcoming challenges...stay tuned !<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiny:</b></div><hr/><i> Neat idea.Amazed that you have not yet secured a ribbon.Just a matter of time I guess. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Ha...I guess my time will come ! For 30 votes or so, I thought this would be it !  Oh well...I do have a 7.2 image that did not get a ribbon ! I usually have great ideas and don''t try to shoot it or fail as shooting it. This one almost succeded. I have a few ideas for upcoming challenges...stay tuned ! Originally posted by Tiny: Neat idea.Amazed that you have not yet secured a ribbon.Just a matter of time I guess. ', '2011-06-01 14:56:13.000000', NULL, 0),
