(6431669, 953132, 17513, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by JuliBoc:</b></div><hr/><i> This really offends me. I can''t be objective, so I''m not voting. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>how can it offend you?????  its art..its a brilliant image with a powerful message.and deserved to be rated higher in my opinion.<br/> <br/>to be a top photographer you have to be open to OTHER peoples ideas.a good picture to me is one that causes disgusions like this and so far its the only picture in this group that has done so.far more creative than any other picture in this challenge.if i could change it to 10/10 i would .( this is my opinion so hope this doesnt offend anyone!!)</td>', 'Originally posted by JuliBoc: This really offends me. I can''t be objective, so I''m not voting.   how can it offend you?????  its art..its a brilliant image with a powerful message.and deserved to be rated higher in my opinion. to be a top photographer you have to be open to OTHER peoples ideas.a good picture to me is one that causes disgusions like this and so far its the only picture in this group that has done so.far more creative than any other picture in this challenge.if i could change it to 10/10 i would .( this is my opinion so hope this doesnt offend anyone!!)', '2011-06-02 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 0),
