(6432076, 953080, 77196, '<td valign="top">You don''t pick easy shots, do you? With a bright (for a camera) light bulb top center, the lighting is challenging at best. Nice focus / composition. I love the unexpectedness of a framed painting in the fridge (cold art?)!</td>', 'You don''t pick easy shots, do you? With a bright (for a camera) light bulb top center, the lighting is challenging at best. Nice focus / composition. I love the unexpectedness of a framed painting in the fridge (cold art?)!', '2011-06-02 18:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
