(6434826, 952852, 131284, '<td valign="top">Cheers for all the comments, and thanks JuliBoc - you''re right, the problem was the vignette. Unfortunately I assumed basic editing meant "can use any of the sliders in lightroom"... now I have carefully read through the rules and know better so hopefully this will be my last dq for a while =). Rather annoyingly in retrospect I prefer this image edited a little differently without any vignetting but ah well.<br/> <br/>aKiwi: I agree, when taking the picture I was thinking exactly the same thing, although unfortunately I''m not sure I was meant to be there or taking pictures so I didn''t have much of a choice in the matter :&lt;.</td>', 'Cheers for all the comments, and thanks JuliBoc - you''re right, the problem was the vignette. Unfortunately I assumed basic editing meant "can use any of the sliders in lightroom"... now I have carefully read through the rules and know better so hopefully this will be my last dq for a while =). Rather annoyingly in retrospect I prefer this image edited a little differently without any vignetting but ah well. aKiwi: I agree, when taking the picture I was thinking exactly the same thing, although unfortunately I''m not sure I was meant to be there or taking pictures so I didn''t have much of a choice in the matter :<.', '2011-06-05 18:26:00.000000', NULL, 0),
