(6437314, 953197, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nightpixels:</b></div><hr/><i> Forget about the lighting, give us the ingredients of this thing, lol! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Excellent question :-) Here we go:<br/>- skin = endive<br/>- nose + cheek = potato<br/>- chin = pear<br/>- mouth = tomato<br/>- base of the neck = slices of cheese<br/>- border of the hat = zucchini<br/>- hair = pasta<br/>- eyes = green and black olives + green pepper<br/> <br/>All of these were fixed on a metallic structure with thin white wires.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by nightpixels: Forget about the lighting, give us the ingredients of this thing, lol!   Excellent question :-) Here we go:- skin = endive- nose + cheek = potato- chin = pear- mouth = tomato- base of the neck = slices of cheese- border of the hat = zucchini- hair = pasta- eyes = green and black olives + green pepper All of these were fixed on a metallic structure with thin white wires.', '2011-06-07 18:50:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6437344, 953197, 112972, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nightpixels:</b></div><hr/><i> Forget about the lighting, give us the ingredients of this thing, lol! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Excellent question :-) Here we go:<br/>- skin = endive<br/>- nose + cheek = potato<br/>- chin = pear<br/>- mouth = tomato<br/>- base of the neck = slices of cheese<br/>- border of the hat = zucchini<br/>- hair = pasta<br/>- eyes = green and black olives + green pepper<br/> <br/>All of these were fixed on a metallic structure with thin white wires. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Love it, thanks!  Much kudos to your wife for creating this!</td>', 'Originally posted by gyaban: Originally posted by nightpixels: Forget about the lighting, give us the ingredients of this thing, lol!   Excellent question :-) Here we go:- skin = endive- nose + cheek = potato- chin = pear- mouth = tomato- base of the neck = slices of cheese- border of the hat = zucchini- hair = pasta- eyes = green and black olives + green pepper All of these were fixed on a metallic structure with thin white wires.   Love it, thanks!  Much kudos to your wife for creating this!', '2011-06-07 19:09:17.000000', NULL, 0),
